          "description": "A manooba can stir up the 'snow' around it to blast snow chunks at its enemies within a 30-ft.-radius. Creatures within the area of effect must make a Fortitude save (DC 18) or be inflicted with Blind status for 1d4 rounds. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 2nd level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 19).",
